      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit comes out of the building, shouts, and does not dodge. When his thick and strong arms interact with the city crushing hammer, dozens of Gu worms fly out and circle him. Cleanse Sky then makes the giant golden hammer vanish without a trace. Only the air currents remain, blowing as strong winds.",
      "chapters": [
        880
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
